.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "25 September 2026" "libmyutils v1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string from source to destination
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <mystrfunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mystrcpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mystrcpy ()
function copies the string pointed to by
.I src
including the terminating null byte ('\0') into the buffer pointed to by
.I dest
and returns the number of characters copied.
